      "content": "The constant management of grid frequency is indeed a massive feat of engineering, which is why it is so carefully controlled by centralized systems. This precise control is *because* of the immense power and infrastructure involved, not to hide a secret agenda. To suggest that this existing, necessary control could be used for subtle, undetectable psychological nudges is a logical leap beyond what is supported by engineering reality. The stability itself is the primary, overwhelming purpose of that constant adjustment.",
